                    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pen"></i>
                    @(_isAppeal ? "Appeal Form" : "Objection Form") &nbsp;·&nbsp; GV23 / Supplementary Valuation Roll
                </div>
                <h3 class="obj-prop-header-title">
                    Description of Property in Respect of which the
                    <span>@(_isAppeal ? "Appeal" : "Objection")</span> is Made
                </h3>
                <p class="obj-prop-header-sub">(Complete a separate form for each entry objected to)</p>

                <div class="obj-prop-header-pill">
